{"availability":"available","full":"anT0ny54/DOH-Cloudflare-Worker","name":"DOH-Cloudflare-Worker","description":"DoH — Cloudflare Worker","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-26T17:12:40Z","updated":"2026-10-18T00:19:28Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://dns.mydoh.workers.dev/","topics":[],"demo":"https://dns.mydoh.workers.dev/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:26.097Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:26.097Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:26.097Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:07:55.173Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T07:13:24.225Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-19T18:04:26.097Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A lightweight Cloudflare Worker that exposes a standard DNS-over-HTTPS endpoint, uses three HaGeZi resolvers with intelligent staged failover, and keeps a two-level DNS cache (Worker version 0.5.3, 113-test suite, green CI):","No other DNS upstreams or resolver profiles are used by the Worker. (The \"Free DNS Services\" table further down lists separate hosted deployments; the Worker never contacts them.) According to HaGeZi's published server list, the three endpoints are hosted in different locations (Falkenstein DE, Nuremberg DE and Helsinki FI), which is what makes them useful as mutual backups."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/anT0ny54/DOH-Cloudflare-Worker/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"56565b205f82e3d8abdc3fd1ddc00121b8ade6239fa32cb8c18adb273795f996","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:26.182Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:26.182Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A lightweight Cloudflare Worker that exposes a standard DNS-over-HTTPS endpoint, uses three HaGeZi resolvers with intelligent staged failover, and keeps a two-level DNS cache (Worker version 0.5.3, 113-test suite, green CI):","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/anT0ny54/DOH-Cloudflare-Worker/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Any ARCOUNT additional records are then walked and must be complete: a single valid EDNS OPT record (root owner name) is accepted, provided its options (code, length, data) tile the OPT RDATA exactly, while a wrong ARCOUNT, a truncated or duplicate OPT record, an option whose length overruns the RDATA (or a dangling partial option header), or undeclared trailing bytes are…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/anT0ny54/DOH-Cloudflare-Worker/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The suite (113 tests) mocks fetch and the Cache API, so it needs no network or Cloudflare account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/anT0ny54/DOH-Cloudflare-Worker/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"56565b205f82e3d8abdc3fd1ddc00121b8ade6239fa32cb8c18adb273795f996","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/anT0ny54/DOH-Cloudflare-Worker/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:26.182Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-18T00:19:28Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/anT0ny54/DOH-Cloudflare-Worker/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:26.183Z","hash":"56565b205f82e3d8abdc3fd1ddc00121b8ade6239fa32cb8c18adb273795f996","originalBytes":23215,"storedBytes":23215,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:26.097Z","subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Other","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Crypto & blockchain","Templates & UI components","Data & dashboards","Privacy & security"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://dns.mydoh.workers.dev/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-19T18:20:15.265Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T18:20:15.265Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-19T18:20:15.265Z","target":"https://dn